estaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"RTJiMomkeeDi5LZn0GhxQA","review_id":"_N7Ik10JookkLuyUYMjZ8A","date":"2018-05-20T22:18:38","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.947373628616333,"text_excerpt":"We went here last night for the first time to celebrate my birthday. We arrived 15 min before our reservation and they sat us right away. Our server was very pleasant and attentive. We ordered cocktails first. My husband ordered a cocktail from their special cocktail menu called the papa old fashioned, but was brought straight bourbon instead. I had the Cajun Famingo, and it was very refreshing. For appetizers, we went with the grit tots, which alone were kind of plain. With the dipping sauce, an entire new level! The fried candied pork ribs were very tasty. It would have been nice to have 4 instead of 3,especially when there are 2 of you. Entries: I had the special- fried snow crab on fe..."},{"business_id":"RTJiMomkeeDi5LZn0GhxQA","review_id":"CqTvWvkFlIpuXGXA-XRfEw","date":"2017-12-15T13:48:15","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9423313140869141,"text_excerpt":"I had a really great experience here! It was \"hot and new\" on Yelp's list, so I was intrigued to try it out. We stopped in for a quick appetizer while waiting for our restaurant of choice to open. It was a Sunday afternoon and not too busy. The staff was helpful and friendly. They let us bring our outside drinks in to finish as well. I ordered the mussels, which were to die for. I can taste them now: savory, buttery, saucy=fantastic! It's currently making me hungry and crave them In fact, since having them, I haven't found any others that compare. I would definitely come back here again!"},{"business_id":"RTJiMomkeeDi5LZn0GhxQA","review_id":"RBQZ12w8wI356SqeWn4gvg","date":"2018-02-27T04:24:39","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9398245811462402,"text_excerpt":"Came here after a long day of walking around the French Quarter and really enjoyed my meal. I combined a few small plates and feel free to ask for modifications as this with most restaurants in NOLA they're not super vegetarian friendly. The sides on the chicken dish were very tasty! I have always been looking for pea puree on a menu since hearing it be very hyped up on one particular episode of Top Chef. This one did not disappoint from the consistency to the flavor it was very good, the mushrooms and potatoes that came with the entree were also delicious. One thing that I was looking forward to trying where the grit tots but they were out so I guess that speaks to how good they were. Th..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"RTJiMomkeeDi5LZn0GhxQA","photo_id":"2E0KQ7dIGkfzVMdWauaFuA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/2E0KQ7dIGkfzVMdWauaFuA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8962208032608032},{"business_id":"RTJiMomkeeDi5LZn0GhxQA","photo_id":"v0dngq1H9JjYwDm5cFwBig","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/v0dngq1H9JjYwDm5cFwBig.jpg","visual_representativene